{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14364","headline":"泾渭扬清浊 · 吕牧","name":"泾渭扬清浊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泾渭横秦野，逶迤近帝城。\n二渠通作润，万户映皆清。\n明晦看殊色，潺湲听一声。\n岸虚深草掩，波五晓烟轻。\n御猎思投钓，渔歌好濯缨。\n合流知禹力，同共到沧瀛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}